stateDiagram-v2
  accTitle: Outreach draft and delivery outcomes
  accDescr: Reviewed inputs can enter the queue only after readiness checks. Changed inputs require review again. Queue acceptance is separate from provider and delivery outcomes.
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Reviewed: Inspect recipients, content and account
  Reviewed --> Draft: Inputs or settings change
  Reviewed --> Blocked: Admission readiness fails
  Reviewed --> Queued: Readiness passes
  Queued --> Held: Final readiness fails
  Queued --> ProviderAccepted: Provider accepts attempt
  Queued --> Failed: Definitive failure
  Queued --> Uncertain: Receipt not confirmed
  ProviderAccepted --> DeliveryReceipt: Provider reports delivery state
  Held --> ExplicitReview: No automatic replay
  Uncertain --> InspectActivity: Review before retry
